<title>MOROCCO: PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Oct 28.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Oct 28.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Moroccan press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>L'OPINION</p>
<p>- Morocco dismantles illegal immigration ring.</p>
<p>- ONA group says it plans to focus its activity on finance, mining and agro-industry.</p>
<p>AL BAYANE</p>
<p>- 800 jobless graduates stage indefinite sit-in in a union headquarters in Rabat to press for jobs.</p>
</text>
